{"id":"steam-1061210","steam":1061210,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Trucker's Dynasty - Cuba Libre","summary":"Start your own family and lead them into a secure future in Trucker's Dynasty: Cuba Libre.","about":"\"Trucker Dynasty: Cuba Libre\" offers a completely new gaming experience: a real life-, truck and business simulation in a fascinating world with a unique storyline and many possibilities. \r\n\r\nCuba - sun, music, dance, rum, cigars and not to forget the many beautiful beaches that invite you to stay. Uncertain political and economical conditions lead to privations in everyday life.   \r\n\r\nIn post-revolutionary Cuba in the 1970s you take over a small transport company. From now on write your own story and the story of your Dynasty in \"TRUCKERS DYNASTY - CUBA LIBRE\".","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/library_600x900.jpg?t=1793699788","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/header.jpg?t=1793699788","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/library_hero.jpg?t=1793699788","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/header.jpg?t=1793699788","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1793699788","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/ss_c7e8d9dfd071a3ae0665e43c8d519b45a2bd69cf.600x338.jpg?t=1793699788","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/ss_c7e8d9dfd071a3ae0665e43c8d519b45a2bd69cf.jpg?t=1793699788"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/ss_a3272ca0f2e150778d658713685e04915d517d8f.600x338.jpg?t=1793699788","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061210/ss_a3272ca0f2e150778d658713685e04915d517d8f.jpg?t=1793699